k"],["Mors (drink)","dish/mors-drink"],["Palianytsia","dish/palianytsia"],["Pampushka","dish/pampushka"],["Paska (bread)","dish/paska-bread"],["Pie","dish/pie"],["Plăcintă","dish/placinta"],["Potato pancake","dish/potato-pancake"],["Rakott krumpli","dish/rakott-krumpli"],["Sauerkraut","dish/sauerkraut"],["Solyanka","dish/solyanka"],["Sorrel soup","dish/sorrel-soup"],["Soured milk","dish/soured-milk"],["Steak tartare","dish/steak-tartare"],["Syrniki","dish/syrniki"],["Tsvikli","dish/tsvikli"],["Uszka","dish/uszka"],["Varenyky","dish/varenyky"],["Vatrushka","dish/vatrushka"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/c/c5/Smietana.JPG/500px-Smietana.JPG","w":500,"h":369,"by":"Dobromila","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Smietana.JPG"}}}